        "The phone does not open the page: phone and PC must be on the same Wi-Fi; if the QR does not open, use the PC’s alternative QRs (Wi-Fi, cable, fixed name) or write the address by hand in Chrome or Safari. Inside Messenger or WhatsApp the page often does not open.",
