        "“[[panel.cluster]]”: the first 5 spots, with frequency in MHz, flag, callsign, country, mode, who reported it and UTC time. A tap on a spot takes the radio to that station; without CAT a notice appears. With the filters chosen in Aurora you see the matching ones; if there are fewer than 5 it is filled up with the others. The title can be tapped to close or open the panel (as long as the page stays open; it reopens by itself next time). It is not there if you turned off the DX Cluster in Aurora.",
