        "The six messages, numbered from 1 to 6, with below the tag of what they are ([[phone.kind.grid]], [[phone.kind.report]], [[phone.kind.rreport]], [[phone.kind.rr73]], [[phone.kind.73]], [[phone.kind.cq]]): a tap chooses which one goes out in the next period. Those already transmitted are dimmed; the current one is highlighted; an empty message cannot be tapped.",
