        "“[[agent.kind.dxped]]”: the DXpeditions starting tomorrow, at most three, taken from the NG3K list. If Aurora has saved the list of countries you still need (from the DXpedition panel, not older than 7 days) it warns only for those, otherwise for all. Default “Popup”.",
